  "fullDescription": "🌲🌳 Wildwood Procreate Brush and Vector Clipart Collection 🌲🌳\n\nI’m very eased to Introduce “Wildwood” – my new handcrafted Procreate brush and vector graphic collection, which is deeply inspired by the heart of the forest. If you’re looking to bring a touch of nature to your work, I’ve made this set to echo the spirit of the wild.\n\n—\n\n🌿 Key Features:🌿\n\n– **Unique Design Inspiration:** Dive deep into the woods with elements ranging from whimsical mushrooms to intricate branches, capturing the essence of the forest and the beauty of nature.\n\n– **Varied Formats**: Comes in multiple formats to suit your design needs – vector EPS clipart, Illustrator AI, and PNG with transparent backgrounds.\n\n– **High-Quality Graphics:** Ensured clarity with 300dpi resolution, making your designs pop with sharpness and detail.\n\n– **Linocutting & Vintage Touch:** The bold and retro feel of the brushes is reminiscent of traditional lino cut and vintage design. It’s perfect for those looking for that woodblock retro vibe.\n\n– **Over 70 Elements:** A comprehensive collection that includes everything from foliage to frames and borders, offering versatility for a multitude of projects.\n\n– **For the Adventurous Spirit:** Whether it’s a design for a vintage poster, an invitation, or digital art, the Wildwood collection brings a touch of adventure to every piece.\n\n—\n\n🌿What’s included?🌿\n\n– Procreate .brushset file\n– Vector EPS\n– Vector AI\n– Transparent PNGs\n\nIncorporate the essence of the forest and traditional printing methods into your artworks. Crafted with passion and precision, it’s a brush bundle that ensures your designs are not just seen, but truly felt. Welcome to the Wildwood, where every stroke tells a story.",
